A quick list of Ansible commands DevOps/Cloud Engineer keep handy:
 
• ansible --version     → Check Ansible version  
 • ansible all -m ping    → Test connectivity to hosts  
 • ansible-inventory --list → Show inventory details  
 • ansible all -a "uptime"  → Run ad-hoc command on hosts  
 • ansible-playbook site.yml → Run a playbook  
 • ansible-playbook --check site.yml → Dry run (no changes)  
 • ansible-playbook --syntax-check site.yml → Validate playbook syntax  
 • ansible-galaxy install <role> → Install a role from Ansible Galaxy  
 • ansible-vault create file.yml  → Create encrypted file  
 • ansible-vault edit file.yml   → Edit encrypted file  
 • ansible-vault view file.yml   → View encrypted file  
 • ansible-vault encrypt file.yml → Encrypt a file  
 • ansible-vault decrypt file.yml → Decrypt a file  
